      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONNIES CAM (13) has had four runs this prep without filling a placing. Added to the sequence last time over 1780m at this track, finishing 10 metres away from the winner in fifth. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he has the ability to mix it with them. ROSIES BOY (12) finished seventh at Albion Park two runs ago before finishing sixth at his latest appearance over 1780m here, beaten 12 metres. Meets some better types this time but a return to form is not out of the question. ROCKNROLL DA GAMA (1) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 1780m at this circuit. Include from the coveted pegs draw. KEAYANG TARA (3) was unplaced two starts ago then things went wrong last start when she broke and finished 11 metres away in fifth over 1780m at this venue. Must get things right but if she does a big run is on the cards.",
